                <pb facs="0238" n="132" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg132"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wharton to Mr. Egan</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-06-01"><hi rendition="#italic">June 1,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Wharton instructs Mr. Egan to telegraph a condensed statement of the
                    situation, both military and political, and to write a full report and send the
                    same by mail.</p>
            </div>
